in_tal_s\": 30.0,\r\n    \"required_max_tal_s\": 60.0,\r\n    \"status\": \"non-compliant\"\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n\r\n... and 45 more runs\r\n\r\nCompliant: 2, Non-compliant: 53\r\n"]
